      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You most likely have errors in your project, which will cause the SDK to fail to load. This is not an SDK issue, but just how the unity editor works. If a script has errors, it will fail to compile, and your project cannot work with compilation errors. Check your console and see what scripts are causing issues, the most common case is unity store assets from old versions of unity not compatible with 2018. Also make sure you're using the latest version of other assets, plugins, shaders etc.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
